Package: slozos-pro-desktop
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: SlozOS <https://github.com/JackachuYT/SlozOS-Pro>
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Depends: gnome-shell (>= 46), plymouth, python3, libglib2.0-bin
Recommends: systemd-zram-generator
Homepage: https://github.com/JackachuYT/SlozOS-Pro
Description: SlozOS Pro desktop: Windows 11-style design, tuning and branding
 The SlozOS Pro look for Zorin OS Core: a centred taskbar with a
 Windows 11-style Start menu, snap layouts, Fluent theme, icons and
 cursors, the Selawik font, SlozOS Pro wallpapers, boot splash and boot
 menu, and SlozOS Pro branding everywhere. Also tunes memory use
 (compressed RAM swap) so the desktop stays quick on modest PCs.
